/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (This course provides an in-depth understanding of operating systems, including their design, functions, and user interfaces. The course emphasizes solving problems in distributed and concurrent systems using computing theory and mathematics. Students will also learn to implement software solutions within system constraints and predict system behavior under random events using probability and expectation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
